<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h2 style="color: #1a1a2e;">You've been invited to DocCraft Admin</h2>
  <p>Hi {{#if fullName}}{{fullName}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>
  <p>You've been added as <strong>{{role}}</strong> on the DocCraft Admin Control Plane.</p>
  <div style="background: #f4f4f8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666;">Email</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a2e;">{{email}}</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666;">Temporary Password</p>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #6c63ff;">{{token}}</p>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">Sign in with this email and temporary password, then change your password immediately from Settings. This password was generated only for your invite and isn't reused for any other account.</p>
</div>
